      "top": 0.3735361111111111,
      "width": 0.3925564640000003,
      "height": 0.01132121212121212
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "and fail is not always intuitive, and validating generated text is",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.5195343137254902,
      "top": 0.38737323232323234,
      "width": 0.3925639360000002,
      "height": 0.01132121212121212
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "significantly more difficult to verify than in-context highlights. Ad-",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "left": 0.5195343137254902,
      "top": 0.40121035353535356,
      "width": 0.39503123435294135,
      "height": 0.01132121212121212
    }
  },
  {
    "str": "ditionally, these tools allow the specification of their behavior only",
    "box": {
      "pageNumber": 1,
